    _root_.GlobalTheory.HeightCounting.TopA.conclusion_of_local_parameters_true hA hL hdR hR hC (setAut D hE lab h A C tm tg hl) hE cf' jE rep hray hT'
      { Γ with kv := kv, tg_tame := hkv } hζ hχ' T hlab hconj Rs hrow
